from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=10,prereqs=[3,9],lead=P("Understand processes, threads, scheduling, virtual memory and files. Reproduce a lost update deliberately and repair it with a lock.","理解进程、线程、调度、虚拟内存与文件，有意复现丢失更新并用锁修复。"),before=P("Know program state and memory. The labs run a short child process, create temporary files and join finite worker threads.","了解程序状态与内存。实验运行短子进程、创建临时文件并等待有限线程。"),outcomes=[P("Distinguish processes and threads.","区分进程与线程。"),P("Compare scheduling objectives.","比较调度目标。"),P("Explain address translation.","解释地址转换。"),P("Use scoped file operations.","使用有作用域文件操作。"),P("Identify and protect critical sections.","识别并保护临界区。")],sections=[
S("Processes and threads","进程与线程","<p>A process is an executing program with resources and an address-space context. Threads within a process share memory but have separate execution state and stacks. Separate processes usually isolate ordinary memory; communication needs pipes, sockets or explicitly shared facilities. A process may be ready, running or blocked waiting for I/O. A program file is passive; multiple processes can execute that same file. Thread concurrency does not imply simultaneous CPU execution, and interpreter-specific constraints should not be confused with operating-system guarantees.</p>","<p>进程是带资源与地址空间上下文的运行程序。进程内线程共享内存，但有独立执行状态与栈。不同进程通常隔离普通内存，通信需管道、套接字或共享设施。进程可就绪、运行或因 I/O 阻塞。程序文件静态，同一文件可由多个进程执行。线程并发不代表 CPU 同时执行，解释器限制不同于系统保证。</p>","Do two threads in one process share all stack frames?","同进程两线程共享全部栈帧吗？","No; their execution stacks are separate, while shared objects may be accessed by both.","不，栈独立，但可访问共享对象。"),
S("Scheduling and context switching","调度与上下文切换","<p>A scheduler chooses ready work. First-come-first-served is simple but a long job delays short jobs. Round robin rotates a time quantum among ready tasks, improving interactive response while increasing switching overhead if the quantum is tiny. Turnaround measures completion minus arrival; response measures first service minus arrival. Saving and restoring registers allows execution to resume after a context switch. Fairness, throughput and latency are different objectives; a policy cannot be judged without its workload and goal.</p>","<p>调度器选择就绪工作。先来先服务简单，但长任务阻挡短任务。时间片轮转改善交互响应，片过小增加切换开销。周转为完成减到达，响应为首次服务减到达。保存恢复寄存器让切换后继续。公平、吞吐与延迟是不同目标，评估策略需负载与目标。</p>","Is response time identical to turnaround time?","响应时间等于周转时间吗？","No; a job may start quickly but finish much later.","不，任务可很早开始却很晚完成。"),
S("Virtual memory and paging","虚拟内存与分页","<p>Programs use virtual addresses translated to physical storage through page mappings. A page number chooses a mapping; an offset chooses a byte within that page. With 4096-byte pages, virtual address 8197 has page 2 and offset 5. Protection and separate mappings isolate processes; a TLB caches translations. A page fault transfers control to the operating system and may allocate, load or reject access. It does not always mean a disk read. Virtual memory is an address-space abstraction, not simply extra RAM from a disk.</p>","<p>虚拟地址通过页映射转换到物理存储，页号选映射、偏移选页内字节。4096 字节页中地址 8197 为页二、偏移五。权限与独立映射隔离进程，TLB 缓存转换。缺页把控制交给系统，可分配、加载或拒绝，并非总读磁盘。虚拟内存是地址空间抽象，而非仅用磁盘增加 RAM。</p>","For 1024-byte pages, split virtual address 2051.","1024 字节页中，2051 如何拆分？","Page 2, offset 3.","页二、偏移三。"),
S("Files, handles and persistence","文件、句柄与持久化","<p>A file provides persistent named data; a handle tracks an open instance and its position. Close resources reliably with a context manager even after an exception. A directory organises names, while permissions govern allowed operations. Buffering means a successful write call need not imply durable storage on physical media. Applications needing crash-safe updates require explicit durability and atomicity policies. Our temporary-directory lab cleans its own files and demonstrates lifetime, not durable database transactions.</p>","<p>文件提供有名字的持久数据，句柄跟踪打开实例与位置。用上下文管理器在异常后也可靠关闭。目录组织名字，权限管理操作。缓冲意味着写调用成功不一定已物理持久。抗崩溃更新需明确持久与原子策略。临时目录实验展示生命周期，而非持久数据库事务。</p>","Does writing to a buffer guarantee survival after power loss?","写入缓冲保证断电后仍在吗？","No; durability requires additional guarantees.","不保证，持久性需额外保证。"),
S("Race conditions, locks and deadlock","竞态、锁与死锁","<p>A read-modify-write operation can interleave: both threads read zero, both write one, and one increment is lost. Protect the whole critical section with a shared lock, not just its final write. Python's GIL in conventional builds is not an application-level transaction guarantee. Deadlock can arise when threads hold one resource while waiting for another in a cycle. A consistent global lock order helps prevent such cycles. The barrier lab forces a particular schedule, making the race reproducible without relying on sleeps or chance.</p>","<p>读改写可交错：双方读零、都写一，一次递增丢失。需同一锁保护整个临界区，而非仅最终写。常规 Python 的 GIL 不是应用事务保证。线程持有资源并循环等待其他资源可死锁，统一锁顺序有助避免。屏障实验强制特定顺序，无需依赖睡眠或随机机会。</p>","Why is locking only the assignment insufficient?","为何只锁赋值不足？","The stale read may already have occurred outside the lock.","陈旧读取可能已在锁外发生。")],
labs=[dict(file="m10_process.py",title=P("Processes and scoped files","进程与作用域文件"),intro=P("Check that the child has a different process ID without embedding machine-dependent IDs in the output.","检查子进程 ID 不同，输出不嵌入机器相关 ID。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Make the child exit with a nonzero code.</li><li>Catch CalledProcessError at the caller.</li><li>Explain why the temporary path disappears.</li></ol>","<ol><li>让子进程非零退出。</li><li>在调用者捕获 CalledProcessError。</li><li>解释临时路径为何消失。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>check=True converts a nonzero exit into CalledProcessError; inspect its returncode. TemporaryDirectory's context exit removes its own contents, even when control leaves through an exception.</p>","<p>check=True 把非零退出转为 CalledProcessError，可查 returncode。临时目录上下文结束会清理自身内容，异常退出也如此。</p>")),dict(file="m10_race.py",title=P("Force and repair a race","强制并修复竞态"),intro=P("The barrier ensures both unsafe workers have read the old value before either writes. The safe version locks the full update.","屏障确保双方写前都已读旧值，安全版本锁住完整更新。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Draw the forced two-thread interleaving.</li><li>Move the read outside the safe lock and explain the regression.</li><li>Explain why putting the barrier inside a one-thread-at-a-time lock would block progress.</li></ol>","<ol><li>画强制交错。</li><li>把读取移到锁外，解释错误。</li><li>解释屏障放进互斥锁为何阻碍推进。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Read A=0, read B=0, then both write 1. A read outside the lock can be stale. If one worker holds the lock while waiting at a two-party barrier, the other cannot acquire the lock to reach it; the timeout exposes the deadlock pattern.</p>","<p>A 读零、B 读零，双方写一。锁外读取可陈旧。若持锁者等双人屏障，另一人无法取锁到达，超时暴露死锁模式。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Program versus process","程序与进程","Can one program file have two running processes?","一个文件可有两个运行进程吗？","<p>Yes; each invocation can have separate state and resources.</p>","<p>可以，每次启动有独立状态与资源。</p>"),E(1,"Page split","页拆分","Split address 4100 with 4096-byte pages.","4096 字节页拆分 4100。","<p>Page 1, offset 4.</p>","<p>页一，偏移四。</p>"),E(2,"Scheduling","调度","Jobs A=8 and B=1 arrive together. Compare FCFS A-first with B-first mean turnaround.","任务八与一同时到达，比较先 A 与先 B 平均周转。","<p>A-first completion 8,9 gives 8.5; B-first 1,9 gives 5. Ordering affects mean completion even with identical work.</p>","<p>先 A 完成八九，平均 8.5；先 B 一九，平均五。工作相同，顺序影响均值。</p>"),E(2,"Lost update","丢失更新","Two workers read 5 and each writes old+1. Final value?","双方读五并写旧值加一，结果？","<p>6, not the intended 7.</p>","<p>六而非七。</p>"),E(2,"Shared state","共享状态","Which needs coordination: shared dictionary or thread-local loop index?","共享字典与线程局部循环索引哪个需协调？","<p>Shared mutable dictionary invariants need coordination; independent local indices do not by themselves create a shared-state race.</p>","<p>共享可变字典不变式需协调，独立局部索引本身不造成共享竞态。</p>"),E(3,"Deadlock order","死锁顺序","Two workers need locks X and Y. Give a consistent acquisition rule.","两线程需 X、Y 锁，给一致获取规则。","<p>All workers acquire X before Y and release in reverse order. This removes the X→Y versus Y→X circular wait for these locks.</p>","<p>都先 X 后 Y，反序释放，移除两锁相反获取的循环等待。</p>"),E(3,"Critical boundary","临界区边界","A last copy is borrowed by two callers. What must be atomic?","两调用者借最后一本，什么需原子？","<p>The availability check and decrement/loan creation must be one coordinated transaction. Locking only the decrement cannot prevent both callers passing the earlier check.</p>","<p>库存检查、扣减与借阅创建需统一事务，仅锁扣减不能避免双方先通过检查。</p>"),E(2,"Lifetime","生命周期","Why close a file even when parsing raises?","解析异常为何仍需关文件？","<p>Release the resource predictably; a with block arranges cleanup on both normal and exceptional exit.</p>","<p>可靠释放资源，with 在正常与异常退出时都清理。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("Threads in a process share?","同进程线程共享什么？","Address-space objects","地址空间对象","Every stack frame","所有栈帧","No state","不共享状态","Stacks are separate.","栈独立。"),Q("Round robin chooses?","轮转选择什么？","A time quantum per ready task","就绪任务时间片","Only shortest tasks","仅最短任务","Disk pages","磁盘页","It rotates ready work.","轮换就绪工作。"),Q("A page fault always means disk read?","缺页总是读盘吗？","No","不是","Yes","是","Only in Python","仅 Python","Faults can allocate or reject accesses too.","还可分配或拒绝访问。"),Q("A lock should cover?","锁应覆盖什么？","The complete shared invariant update","完整共享不变式更新","Only a final print","仅最后打印","Only local state","仅局部状态","Stale reads outside remain unsafe.","锁外陈旧读取仍危险。"),Q("GIL guarantees application transactions?","GIL 保证应用事务吗？","No","不保证","Always","总保证","Only for lists","仅列表","Explicit coordination is still needed.","仍需明确协调。"),Q("Consistent lock order helps prevent?","一致锁顺序有助避免什么？","Circular wait","循环等待","All runtime errors","所有错误","File encoding","文件编码","It addresses a deadlock condition.","针对死锁条件。")],pitfalls=[P("Concurrency is possible without simultaneous execution.","并发可以不同时执行。"),P("A page fault is not necessarily an error or disk operation.","缺页未必是错误或磁盘操作。")],reading=[(P("OSTEP processes","OSTEP 进程"),"https://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~remzi/OSTEP/cpu-intro.pdf",P("Read process states and distinguish ready from running.","阅读进程状态，区分就绪与运行。")),(P("OSTEP locks","OSTEP 锁"),"https://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~remzi/OSTEP/threads-locks.pdf",P("Trace a lost update and its protected version.","跟踪丢失更新与保护版本。"))],terms=[(P("Context switch","上下文切换"),P("Saving and restoring execution state to change running work.","保存恢复执行状态以切换运行工作。")),(P("Critical section","临界区"),P("Operations requiring coordinated access to shared state.","需协调访问共享状态的操作。")),(P("Virtual address","虚拟地址"),P("An address interpreted through a process's mapping context.","通过进程映射上下文解释的地址。"))],review=P("<p>Explain exactly how the barrier causes a lost update, then state the locked invariant. Module 11 connects processes through network protocols.</p>","<p>解释屏障如何产生丢失更新，再说明锁保护的不变式。模块 11 将通过协议连接进程。</p>")))
